	// MECHANISM-2: During spikes, instances with high BatchSize have active GPU contention while those with high QueueDepth just have waiting requests. Penalizing BatchSize more heavily steers new requests to instances with less active work.
	// EXPECT-2: load_spikes_e2e_ms < 3300
